---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /staff/induction/complete/
title: Induction complete
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="page-hd page-hd-tall page-hd-staff">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Thank you, your induction is complete</h1>
    <p class="lead">We've been notified and will save it to your file. Welcome to the Every Human team. We're glad you're here.</p>
    <p>If you have any questions, call us on <a href="{{ site.phone | telLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    <div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-go" href="#" download hidden data-cert>Download your certificate (PDF)</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/staff/">Go to the Staff Portal</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
try{localStorage.removeItem("eh-induction")}catch(e){}
try{var c=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem("eh-cert")||"null");if(c){var a=document.querySelector("[data-cert]");a.href=c.data;a.download=c.name;a.hidden=false}}catch(e){}
</script>
